<title>FINLAND: Finnish T-bill auction raises 2.17 bln markka.</title>
<headline>Finnish T-bill auction raises 2.17 bln markka.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the State Treasury Office's T-Bill auction January 7 versus December 17:</p>
<p>		     THIS AUCTION/PREVIOUS AUCTION</p>
<p> Maturity, days   96/85     187/n/a    340/361</p>
<p> Avge yld, pct   3.05/3.03   3.16     3.34/3.38</p>
<p> Highest yld     3.05/3.03   3.16     3.35/3.38</p>
<p> Lowest  yld     3.04/3.02   3.15     3.34/3.38</p>
<p> Amount, FIM million  760/85	705	700/50</p>
<p> Bids, FIM million  1,420/85    1,195    1,480/70</p>
<p>After today's auction, the outstanding amount of treasury bills is 40,157 million markka, the STO said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0245</p>
</text>
